      15: { title: 'Write a Personal Update', genre: 'mensaje personal', readingTitle: 'News for an old friend', readingText: 'Your friend moved to another city six months ago. You want to write an update about your new course, your routine, and one recent activity. Your friend likes to hear small everyday details.', prompt: 'Write an update to your friend. Mention what has changed and one recent experience.', model: 'Hi Sofia! I hope you are well in your new city. I started an English course two months ago, and I usually study after work now. Last weekend, my class visited a museum together. It was interesting because we spoke English all afternoon. I miss you and hope to visit soon.', terms: [{ term: 'I started', kind: 'estructura' }, { term: 'two months ago', kind: 'adverbio' }, { term: 'usually', kind: 'adverbio' }, { term: 'Last weekend', kind: 'adverbio' }, { term: 'because', kind: 'conector' }, { term: 'hope to', kind: 'estructura' }] },
